# The normal, healthy case: the first pass finds a defect. The reviewer's verdict goes to the
# journal, negotiate proposes one finding and one repair, the driver registers FU001 (repair as
# F004) and F004 (Repairs: C01 of F001) and routes A002 to it; A001 is proven, A002 is NOT
# (a repair is scheduled for it, whatever F002's review said); the advisory halt is journaled
# and the loop dispatches the repair. Round 2 reviews everything again, proves A002 from the
# repair's review, closes M1, and the mission runs to done. (#13, SKILL VALIDATE step 4)
